  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of Kigali HFC implementation plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The preparation of Kigali HFC management plan was approved at the 92nd ExCom Meeting for Burundi. UNEP (lead implementing agency) and UNIDO (co-operating implementing agency) are implementing the project. The National Ozone Unit under Burundi National Institute for the Environment and Protection of Nature is a key national counterpart.  A national Steering Committee was established to control, monitor and manage the elimination of the use of ozone depleting substances in Burundi. The committee comprises of the key stakeholders, and their involvement is crucial in the realization of the goals of the National Ozone Depleting Substances Phase-out and HFC phase down Programme..</narrative>
  </description>
